('Modify','What scale or salience change could help?','enlarge the absent-time field;collapse repeated reason text while exposing all five targets;expand only the definition responsible for a conflict;reduce visual weight of high source weight after scope mismatch'),
('Put to other use','What additional use could the preserved route serve?','generate a creative continuation despite invalid logic;build a retrieval cue for a later threshold question;construct a semantic regression case;record why a tempting route was not followed'),
